{"t":"Magical Blending Device","s":"magical-blending-device-82c4c","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Magical_Blending_Device_d49569.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Magical Blending Device</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Magical Blending Device\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magical_Blending_Device_d49569.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Functional Objects<br/>Machines (Objects)<br/>Quest Objects</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20090622155946&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magical_Blending_Device_d49569.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a magical blending device.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Place ingredients in bowl, then pull lever to grind and blend them. Only for smart magical recipes.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Eclesius\">Eclesius</a>' basement laboratory.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Only put in correct ingredients in the correct order for a recipe, and then pull the lever to blend. Any other combination of items you try to blend will be deleted.<br/>Used during <a href=\"#/quest/the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest\">The Scatterbrained Sorcerer Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish%20Flakes\">Fish Flakes</a></li><li>Functional Objects</li><li>Machines (Objects)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest\">The Scatterbrained Sorcerer Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest","quest":"The Scatterbrained Sorcerer Quest","step":"2-2","n":8,"title":"Fazer as Fish Flakes","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}